# Old Man of the Sea's control effect lasts "for as long as this creature remains tapped and that creature's power remains less
# than or equal to this creature's power" (CR 611.2b): a duration of a layer-2 effect (CR 613.1b) that ends on a value of
# layer 7 (CR 613.4c). Bot1's Old Man (2/3) takes Bot2's Llanowar Elves (1/1). Bot2 then casts Turn Inside Out on the Elves:
# at 4/1 its power is greater than Old Man's 2, so the effect ends and the Elves is Bot2's again. When the +3/+0 wears off at
# end of turn the Elves is 1/1 and Old Man is still tapped (Bot1 leaves it tapped in their untap step), but an effect whose
# duration has ended never comes back (CR 611.2b): the Elves stays Bot2's into Bot1's next turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Island
Old Man of the Sea
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Mountain
Turn Inside Out
Forest x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Old Man of the Sea.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Activate(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Turn Inside Out.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 4
Bot1.Decline
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Island; Old Man of the Sea
Bot1.Battlefield.Old Man of the Sea.Tapped = true
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mountain; Llanowar Elves
Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 1
